></li><li class="aq-hold-timeline__st is-up is-hold" style="--i:5;--x:91.67%"><span class="aq-hold-timeline__pole" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="aq-hold-timeline__node" aria-hidden="true"><span class="aq-hold-timeline__halo"></span></span><div class="aq-hold-timeline__c"><h3 class="aq-hold-timeline__t"><span class="aq-hold-timeline__n" aria-hidden="true">06 /</span> Performance qualification (PQ)</h3><p class="aq-hold-timeline__fig">at least <span class="aq-hold-timeline__num">12</span> months</p><p class="aq-hold-timeline__d">Protocol, sampling plan, phase reports, alert and action levels. Use from phase 2, after at least 2 weeks (WHO TRS 1033).</p><p class="aq-hold-timeline__hold"><span class="aq-hold-timeline__hk">Hold point</span> Signed by your quality unit</p></div></li><li class="aq-hold-timeline__band" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 1000 1000" preserveAspectRatio="none"><polyline class="aq-hold-timeline__rail" points="0.0,1000.0 83.3,916.7 250.0,750.0 416.7,583.3 583.3,416.7 750.0,250.0 916.7,83.3 1000.0,0.0"></polyline><polyline class="aq-hold-timeline__run" points="0.0,1000.0 83.3,916.7 250.0,750.0 416.7,583.3 583.3,416.7 750.0,250.0 916.7,83.3 1000.0,0.0"></polyline></svg><span class="aq-hold-timeline__drop"></span></li></ol></div></div></section>
